{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21951","headline":"白牡丹 · 白居易","name":"白牡丹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"城中看花客，旦暮走营营。\n素华人不顾，亦占牡丹名。\n闭在深寺中，车马无来声。\n唯有钱学士，尽日绕丛行。\n怜此皓然质，无人自芳馨。\n衆嫌我独赏，移植在中庭。\n留景夜不暝，迎光曙先明。\n对之心亦静，虚白相向生。\n唐昌玉蘂花，攀玩衆所争。\n折来比颜色，一种如瑶琼。\n彼因稀见贵，此以多爲轻。\n始知无正色，爱恶随人情。\n岂惟花独尔，理与人事幷。\n君看入时者，紫艳与红英。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21951.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21951","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}